{
  "about": "AC-001G-04b/04c/04f and DEC-8 expected advisory lint results (FEATURE-001-G). 'expected' lists [line, term] pairs; an empty list means no warning. 'documented_miss' marks a known lint miss that only the Maintainer's non_normative attestation covers.",
  "rule_lines": [
    "- MUST pass every untrusted value as a bound parameter, never by string concatenation.",
